	"title": "The Gunslinger Class: Valda’s Spire of Secrets",
	"description": "<p>Gunslingers live on the edge, brandishing six-shooters and shotguns to survive by the skin of their teeth. You’re a maverick, cool under pressure and deadly in a quick-draw. Gunslingers may have few friends, but your enemies will be quaking in their boots.</p><p>Play the Gunslinger class if you enjoy scoring powerful Critical Hits and having an entire arsenal of guns at your disposal. Take aim with 6 subclasses and a host of new maneuvers powered by Risk Dice.</p>",
